DOCUMENT();
loadMacros('PGstandard.pl', 'MathObjects.pl', 'PGcourse.pl');
TEXT(beginproblem());
$showPartialCorrectAnswers = 0;
$prompt = <<'PROMPT_209C_A07B';
<p>209c_a07b</p> <h4>Three-Point Test Cross Problem</h4><p>A test cross is a way to explore the relationship between genes and their respective alleles. It is a useful tool for genetic mapping and deciphering the inheritance of traits. Specifically, a three-point test cross examines three (3) genes at the same time to learn about their assortment in gamete formation.</p><p>A standard three-point test cross involves crossing a heterozygous organism for all three genes with an organism that is homozygous recessive for all three genes</p> <p>For this problem, a test cross using a fruit fly (<i>Drosophila melanogaster</i>) heterozygous for three genes was conducted to understand their genetic interactions.</p><h6>Characteristics of Recessive Phenotypes</h6><p><ul><li><strong><span style="color: #a32d36;">Gene C</span></strong> is affiliated with the '<span style="color: #a32d36;"><i>chummy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #a32d36;">Gene C</span> shows behavior where it always maintains a close distance to other flies.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #286d3f;">Gene E</span></strong> is linked with the '<span style="color: #286d3f;"><i>eery</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #286d3f;">Gene E</span> appears to have something off, crooked limbs and other twisted appendages.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #1d5bb5;">Gene X</span></strong> is associated with the '<span style="color: #1d5bb5;"><i>xanthic</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #1d5bb5;">Gene X</span> has a fluorescent bright yellow coloring.</li> </ul></p><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border: 2px solid black;"><tr><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Phenotype</span></th><th colspan="3" align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Genotypes</span></th><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Progeny<br/>Count</span></th></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">chummy, eery, xanthic</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe2e2; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">c</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d4f4d6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">e</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e2eaff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">x</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">502</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">chummy, eery</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe2e2; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">c</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d4f4d6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">e</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #1d5bb5;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">3,573</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">chummy, xanthic</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe2e2; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">c</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #286d3f;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e2eaff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">x</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">15,529</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">chummy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe2e2; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">c</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #286d3f;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #1d5bb5;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">10,554</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">eery, xanthic</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #a32d36;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d4f4d6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">e</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e2eaff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">x</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">10,482</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">eery</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #a32d36;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d4f4d6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">e</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #1d5bb5;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">15,485</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">xanthic</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #a32d36;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #286d3f;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e2eaff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">x</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">3,405</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;"><i>wildtype</i></span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #a32d36;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #286d3f;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #1d5bb5;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">470</span></td></tr><tr><th colspan="4" align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">TOTAL =</span></th><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">60,000</span></td></tr></table><p>The resulting phenotypes are summarized in the table above.</p> <h6>Question</h6> <p>With the progeny data from the table, and using only the genotypes that result from crossover events between the two genes <b>C</b> and <b>E</b> during meiosis.</p> <p><strong>calculate the genetic distance between the two genes <b>C</b> and <b>E</b>,</strong> expressing your answer in centimorgans (cM)</p>
PROMPT_209C_A07B
loadMacros('parserRadioButtons.pl');
$choice_1 = <<'LITERAL_209C_A07B_CHOICE_1';
<sup>(15,485 + 15,529)</sup>/<sub>60,000</sub> = <sup>31,014</sup>/<sub>60,000</sub> = 0.5169 = <strong>51.69 cM</strong>
LITERAL_209C_A07B_CHOICE_1
$choice_2 = <<'LITERAL_209C_A07B_CHOICE_2';
<sup>(470 + 3,405 + 3,573 + 15,485)</sup>/<sub>60,000</sub> = <sup>22,933</sup>/<sub>60,000</sub> = 0.3822 = <strong>38.22 cM</strong>
LITERAL_209C_A07B_CHOICE_2
$choice_3 = <<'LITERAL_209C_A07B_CHOICE_3';
<sup>(470 + 502 + 10,482 + 15,485)</sup>/<sub>60,000</sub> = <sup>26,939</sup>/<sub>60,000</sub> = 0.4490 = <strong>44.90 cM</strong>
LITERAL_209C_A07B_CHOICE_3
$choice_4 = <<'LITERAL_209C_A07B_CHOICE_4';
<sup>(470 + 502 + 3,405 + 10,482)</sup>/<sub>60,000</sub> = <sup>14,859</sup>/<sub>60,000</sub> = 0.2477 = <strong>24.77 cM</strong>
LITERAL_209C_A07B_CHOICE_4
$choice_5 = <<'LITERAL_209C_A07B_CHOICE_5';
<sup>(470 + 502 + 3,405 + 3,573)</sup>/<sub>60,000</sub> = <sup>7,950</sup>/<sub>60,000</sub> = 0.1325 = <strong>13.25 cM</strong>
LITERAL_209C_A07B_CHOICE_5
$choice_6 = <<'LITERAL_209C_A07B_CHOICE_6';
<sup>(502 + 3,573 + 10,554 + 15,529)</sup>/<sub>60,000</sub> = <sup>30,158</sup>/<sub>60,000</sub> = 0.5026 = <strong>50.26 cM</strong>
LITERAL_209C_A07B_CHOICE_6
$correct_1 = <<'LITERAL_209C_A07B_CORRECT_1';
<sup>(470 + 502 + 3,405 + 3,573)</sup>/<sub>60,000</sub> = <sup>7,950</sup>/<sub>60,000</sub> = 0.1325 = <strong>13.25 cM</strong>
LITERAL_209C_A07B_CORRECT_1
@choices = ($choice_1, $choice_2, $choice_3, $choice_4, $choice_5, $choice_6);
$answer = RadioButtons([@choices], $correct_1, labels => 'ABC', displayLabels => 1, randomize => 0, noindex => 1, separator => '<div style="margin-bottom: 0.7em;"></div>');
TEXT(MODES(HTML => $prompt, TeX => ''));
BEGIN_TEXT
\{$answer->buttons\}
END_TEXT
ANS($answer->cmp);

ENDDOCUMENT();
